# SEIM documentation

- **SSOT:** `docs/` — manuals, Sphinx (`docs/sphinx/`), generated API/code/DB output (`docs/generated/`), and working notes (`docs/notes/`).
- **Not docs:** `documents/` — Django document-upload app. See `documents/README.md`. Do not merge, move, or delete it.

When you add or change engineering docs, put them under `docs/` (guides at the root of that tree; status/audit/working papers under `docs/notes/`). Keep `make docs-workflow` writing into `docs/`.
